From: Onigiri
Subject: [PATCH] Open DeX Camera on the rear lens by default

Keep explicit voice-selfie and QR launches, the one-shot DeX facing restore,
and ordinary camera facing selection. Change only the default DeX launch
from front (1) to rear (0).

diff --git a/smali_classes4/com/sec/android/app/camera/shootingmode/ShootingModeProviderImpl.smali b/smali_classes4/com/sec/android/app/camera/shootingmode/ShootingModeProviderImpl.smali
--- a/smali_classes4/com/sec/android/app/camera/shootingmode/ShootingModeProviderImpl.smali
+++ b/smali_classes4/com/sec/android/app/camera/shootingmode/ShootingModeProviderImpl.smali
@@ -1185,7 +1185,7 @@
     goto :goto_0
 
     :cond_2
-    iput v3, p0, Lcom/sec/android/app/camera/shootingmode/ShootingModeProviderImpl;->mInitialFacing:I
+    iput v2, p0, Lcom/sec/android/app/camera/shootingmode/ShootingModeProviderImpl;->mInitialFacing:I
 
     :goto_0
     return-void
